<title>FINLAND: NOKIA 9000 COMMUNICATOR WINS AWARD.</title>
<headline>NOKIA 9000 COMMUNICATOR WINS AWARD.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said in a statement on Wednesday its 9000 Communicator which combines a GSM digital mobile phone with a palmtop computer had won the GSM world conference's innovation award.</p>
<p>The award was given at the GSM (Global System for Mobile Communications) Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) conference in Cannes. &quot;The GSM MoU innovation award is the sixth major award for the Nokia 9000 Communicator,&quot; Nokia said.</p>
<p>The association labelled the Communicator a real milestone product in development of mobile data, Nokia said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242</p>
